    "title": "SCDOT seeks input on plan to replace Sumter County bridge - NewsBreak",
    "text": "7 hours ago A key highway bridge in Sumter County is set for replacement, and transportation officials are asking for public input as planning moves forward. The South Carolina Department of Transportation is planning to replace the southbound U.S. 15 bridge over the Pocotaligo River, a route many Sumter County drivers use daily. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
